 Ω omega full v1.2.3 · Guided run
 These are the stages that apply to this machine, in the order that makes sense. Each one starts when the
 one before ends; between two you can go on, skip, repeat or stop, and nothing risky runs without asking.

 ❯ ◼  1  Check omega            omega doctor
   ◼  2  Update                 omega update
   ◼  3  Clean up               omega clean
   ◼  4  What runs on the Mac   omega mac

╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Check omega  omega doctor                                                                                  │
│ What it does  Checks the setup.                                                                            │
│ Why           Everything else needs it.                                                                    │
│ Risk          read-only: it changes nothing                                                                │
╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
 4 of 4 stages will run
  ↑↓ move · space tick or untick · a all · enter start · q leave
